Call-level revision contracts — method sketch

This directory is an original, clean-room sketch written for the playground.
It cites the method of arXiv 2611.06967, "Call-Level Revision Contracts for
LLM-Authored Workflows" (Jiang, Pan, Wu), https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.06967.

The paper is distributed under the arXiv.org perpetual non-exclusive license.
That license is not CC BY and is not a software grant. This sketch is
method-cite only: no implementation and no substantial paper text were copied;
fixtures and code are independently authored. Short quoted excerpts in
paper_evidence.json are for citation checking only.

No upstream code pin: no public implementation URL was found, so none was used.
